    {
      "abstract": "Total cross-section for J/PSI production. The value of the total cross section has been determined by fitting the rapidity distribution with many theoretical and phenomenological shapes. The systematic error quotedwas estimated from the maximum variation allowed by shifting the mid and forward rapidity data independantely by their point-to-point correlated systematic errors.There is a +- 18 nanobarn normalization error in addition to the statistical and systematical errors shown.\n",
